  {
   "position": 5,
   "title": "100% Perfection! This was the ultimate spoil!!!!",
   "snippet": "Terry Black\u2019s BBQ is nothing short of sensational! We booked the VIP package with a pit tour. \nYes it\u2019s expensive but, being a chef and hard to please, this authentic experience was excellent and will forever be etched in my culinary memory. \nThe quality of the Brisket (ask for fatty), Beef Ribs and Steak was truly delicious with generous sides-each of the eight dishes brimming with flavour. \nService from Cesar (his first day on the job) was stellar and he packed the leftovers in a bag weighing in excess of 1KG! \nVisiting from South Africa where our Braais are world renowned, Terry\u2019s BBQ puts us to shame. \nThis is the ultimate Texan BBQ experience. \nPerfection, generosity, flavour (so naturally good, no relishes necessary), vibe, service- it\u2019s remarkable!\nThank you! Fabulous to say the least.",
   "rating": 5,
